            <div class='post' itemprop="text">
              <p>Learn Cardano’s latest ecosystem update covers AlphaGrowth’s Cardano PRIME proposal going live on-chain with a 120 million ada request, the net change limit debate, Ethereum research into native UTXOs, RealFi’s testnet, SecondFi recovery guidance and EMURGO stepping down from the Pentad while it focuses resources on recovery.</p>
<div class="youtube-onebox lazy-video-container" data-video-id="KXt_OrtsHc4" data-video-title="Cardano's 120M ADA DeFi Bet, Ethereum UTXO Shift and EMURGO Exit" data-video-start-time="" data-provider-name="youtube">
